  NpcName: Naius
  tipoVoz: 2
  retrato: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bdc3c36235956b2458cc3113fdd652d6, type: 3}
  dayGreeting:
  - Who dares to interrupt my day and summon me? What does this little human of mine
    want? Oh... You ain't no human...
  - Did you get lost, little Ciros? I know! You summoned me so I could bring you
    back, right? I see in your deformed expression deep hate and resentment.
  - 'Oh, so you saw your mother dead? HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHHAHAHA!! YES, YES!! And She
    was DELICIOUS!! HAHAHAHAHAHA!! '
  - 'And? What are you going to do about it, ugly beast? Are YOU going to kill ME?
    HAHAHAHAH!! I''d love to see you TRY '
  - 'Bring it on, I N S E C T! After this, your father will be a great snack! '
  nightText: 
  partyText: 
  NpcId: Naius9eeccdea-9322-498b-a9fb-ce5fbe9d531a
